ed.\n\n**Still not verified:** the browser test has never been seen passing, and its break patch has not been run. You didn't approve checking whether a shop answers on port 5080, so I couldn't run it against one. A shop started in the background in an earlier attempt may still be running on 5080.\n\nRound 2 of at most 3 has been used. Any of the three answers means running the test stage again.","ttft_ms":1889,"type":"result","duration_ms":93775,"uuid":"9b20fa65-4222-4f22-be98-4c8983722bc1","ttft_stream_ms":1431,"time_to_request_ms":88,"first_content_frame_ms":1431,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
